ERROR HY000: MyRocks supports only READ COMMITTED and REPEATABLE READ isolation levels. Please change from current isolation level SERIALIZABLE
ROLLBACK;
SET SESSION TRANSACTION ISOLATION LEVEL REPEATABLE READ;
SELECT * FROM t1;
a
